wg-augments-tab = Augments
wg-augments-intro = Cyberware this character starts with. Hover over the body and click a part to change it. Priced pieces are bought once from the bank; taking one off sells it back for {$percent}% of its price. Bought cyberware stays only if the character goes into cryo or ends the round alive in their own body; dying, being cloned or respawning loses all of it. Cyberware made or bought during a round works for that round only. A bought piece, or one scavenged from a wreck, keeps its value once it is cut out: it sells like other loot, or whoever ends a round alive with it in their body owns it as bought. Either way the character it came from loses it.
