wg-augment-cyber-arm = Cybernetic arm
wg-augment-cyber-arm-desc = A plain cybernetic arm and hand. Works like flesh, repairs with a welder and cable, and an EMP upsets it.
wg-augment-cyber-leg = Cybernetic leg
wg-augment-cyber-leg-desc = A plain cybernetic leg and foot. Works like flesh, repairs with a welder and cable, and an EMP upsets it.

wg-augment-mantis-blade-left = Mantis blade
wg-augment-mantis-blade-right = Mantis blade
wg-augment-mantis-blade-desc = A blade folded into the forearm that snaps out on command.
wg-augment-dermal-armor = E-SAPI dermal armor
wg-augment-dermal-armor-desc = Armor plates under the skin. Bullets and blades do less; heat and shock do more.
wg-augment-muscle-fibers = Muscle fiber suite
wg-augment-muscle-fibers-desc = Reinforced muscle fibers that let you dash a short way.
wg-augment-tool-arm = PD-VI RM-5 "Verstak" tool arm
wg-augment-tool-arm-desc = A screwdriver, wrench, welder, crowbar, wirecutters and multitool folded into the forearm, picked from a wheel one at a time. An EMP folds it away until it wears off.
wg-augment-smartlink = MMC SL-4 "Shojun" smartlink
wg-augment-smartlink-desc = Links the hand to the gun it holds and compensates for its recoil: the gun barely kicks your view, the spread builds up half as fast as you fire and settles half again as quickly, and its rounds leave the barrel a fifth faster. While linked, your sight shows the gun's rounds by the cursor and brackets the living thing in view nearest your aim. An EMP scrambles the link, and until it wears off the gun kicks harder than it would unlinked.
wg-smartlink-ammo = {$count}/{$capacity}
wg-smartlink-range = {$meters}m
wg-augment-halo-burst = TSF KR-30 "Corona" frag charges
wg-augment-halo-burst-desc = Explosive charges packed round the ribcage. One action throws a ring of amber orbs out round you; two seconds later they all go off, tearing into anyone near them, friend or foe, and throwing them back. Until then you are held still in a shield, and your own blasts pass you by. Holds two bursts, and each comes back on its own after three minutes.
wg-augment-halo-stun = TSF KR-31 "Corona" concussion charges
wg-augment-halo-stun-desc = Concussive charges packed round the ribcage. One action throws a ring of amber orbs out round you; two seconds later they all go off, knocking the wind out of anyone near them, friend or foe, and throwing them back. Until then you are held still in a shield, and your own blasts pass you by. Holds two bursts, and each comes back on its own after three minutes.
wg-burst-launcher-recharged = Corona charge ready ({ $charges }/{ $max }).
wg-augment-thermal-tint-eyes = PD-VI OV-40 "Tapetum" ocular suite
wg-augment-thermal-tint-eyes-desc = Prosthetic eyes with four modes on one action: thermal, which sees body heat through walls, and night vision in green, cyan or white phosphor. They shield your eyes from welding, but not from a flash.
wg-augment-finger-lighter = MMC HB-2 "Hibana" finger lighter
wg-augment-finger-lighter-desc = A lighter in a fingertip. An EMP snuffs it until it wears off.
wg-augment-deployable-emp = The implant doesn't respond.
wg-augment-deployable-stow = Stow the {$item}
wg-augment-adrenal-booster = TSF KR-14 "Ryvok" adrenal booster
wg-augment-adrenal-booster-desc = A booster on the adrenal glands. More stamina, and it comes back sooner and faster. When a stun drops you, it floods you with adrenaline and you are back up a second and a half later with your stamina restored; then it needs two minutes to recover. The adrenaline from a pain shock lasts twice as long.
wg-adrenal-booster-surge = Adrenaline floods you, and you push yourself back up!
wg-adrenal-booster-surge-others = { CAPITALIZE(THE($target)) } shakes it off and gets back up!
wg-adrenal-booster-ready = Your adrenal booster has recovered.
wg-augment-pain-editor = MMC EVT-130 "Mushin" pain inhibitor
wg-augment-pain-editor-desc = A filter on the brainstem that dulls the pain of every wound, so it takes more to put you down.
wg-augment-reflex-booster = PD-VI NR-8 "Strizh" reflex booster
wg-augment-reflex-booster-desc = A booster on the spinal cord that speeds your reflexes. Ships you fly accelerate and turn 15% better, and one bullet in twenty that would hit you misses. Your nerves run hot, so wounds hurt 5% more. Beams still hit.
wg-reflex-booster-dodge = { CAPITALIZE(THE($target)) } twists out of the way!

wg-augment-cyber-chest = PD-VI KS-2 "Kiras" chest chassis
wg-augment-cyber-chest-desc = Your chest rebuilt around a cybernetic frame, in the style of your choice. It holds three implants instead of two, but it counts as synthetic, so implants that need living tissue won't fit.

wg-augment-holo-projector = MMC KG-7 "Kagemusha" holo projector
wg-augment-holo-projector-desc = Holo emitters under the skin of the chest. On command they cast two copies of you about the room you stand in, and you slip into the place of one while the other takes yours. The copies wander for twenty seconds and flicker out when struck; they give off no heat. They never land past a wall, window or door, and a cramped spot or a doorway won't cast at all. Recharges in ninety seconds.
wg-holo-projector-cramped = There's no room here to cast your copies.
wg-augment-threat-sole = PD-VI SP-9 "Sapyor" sole sensors
wg-augment-threat-sole-desc = Sensors in the sole that keep you from setting off land mines, tripwires and other floor traps. One sole is enough; in a cybernetic foot an EMP switches it off with the foot.
wg-augment-nutriment-pump = PD-VI PN-3 "Paek" nutriment pump
wg-augment-nutriment-pump-desc = A pump beside the stomach that feeds you whenever you are starving. It keeps you from starving, not from being hungry.
wg-augment-nutriment-pump-feed = You feel less hungry...
wg-augment-reviver = MMC EVT-090 "Fukkatsu" cardiac reviver
wg-augment-reviver-desc = A defibrillator wired to the heart. When the heart stops it holds your bleeding, runs in a small reserve of blood and shocks, up to three times, on the odds and limits of a medic's paddles. The bleeding stays held for a minute after the shock; your wounds are still there. Then it recharges for ten minutes. An EMP knocks it out for two.
wg-augment-reviver-charging = Something in your chest whines as it charges.
wg-augment-reviver-shock = { CAPITALIZE(THE($target)) } jolts as something in { POSS-ADJ($target) } chest fires!
wg-augment-iatric-monitor = MMC EVT-120 "Kanshi" vitals monitor
wg-augment-iatric-monitor-desc = A monitor behind the eye that reads your own vital signs to you, the way a health analyzer would.

wg-analyzer-cyberware = Cyberware
